<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>XCAR — Аренда авто</title>

<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1f33">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="XCAR">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="icon-192.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="icon-512.png">

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/html2canvas@1.4.1/dist/html2canvas.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode-generator@1.4.4/qrcode.js"></script>

<style>
html{overscroll-behavior-y:none;height:100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
*{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5f7fa,#eef2f7);font-family:system-ui;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:18px;padding-top:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-top));padding-bottom:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));padding-left:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-left));padding-right:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-right));-webkit-touch-callout:none;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;overscroll-behavior-y:none;min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}
input,textarea,select{-webkit-touch-callout:default;-webkit-user-select:text;user-select:text;}
.card{width:100%;max-width:480px;background:#fff;padding:22px 18px 26px 18px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.08);height:calc(100vh - 36px);max-height:calc(100vh - 36px);box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;}
.calculatorScroll{flex:1;min-height:0;max-height:100%;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;touch-action:pan-y;padding:0 2px 10px 0;scrollbar-width:thin;}
.calculatorScroll::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;}
.calculatorScroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(90,98,112,.28);border-radius:10px;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .calculatorScroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(122,162,255,.35);}

.logo{text-align:center;font-size:32px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;transition:transform .15s ease;position:relative;z-index:50;pointer-events:auto;-webkit-user-select:none;touch-action:manipulation;}
.logo:active{transform:scale(.96);}
.logo .x{color:#ff0000;}
.logo .f{color:#001f5b;}

.label{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;color:#2a2f36;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}
.icon{opacity:.7}

input,select{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;margin:6px 0 12px 0;font-size:16px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ec;background:#f9fbfd;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit;}

button{width:100%;padding:14px;margin-top:9px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:none;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;}
.b1{background:#003049}.b7{background:#00c853}.b3{background:#6a5acd}
#installBtn{display:none;background:#6a1b9a;}

.btnRow{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.btnRow button{margin-top:9px;}

.result{margin-top:14px;padding:14px;background:#f3f6fb;font-weight:600;border-radius:14px;white-space:pre-line;}

#dailyBreakdown{display:none;margin-top:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;}
#dailyBreakdown .dTitle{background:#001f5b;color:#fff;padding:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-align:center;}
.dayRow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef1f5;}
.dayRow:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.dayPaid{background:#e7f9ee;}
.dayUnpaid{background:#fdeaea;}
.dayPartial{background:#fff8e1;}
.dayFree{background:#eef4ff;}
.dayDate{font-weight:600;color:#1a1f29;}
.dayAmount{font-weight:700;color:#2a2f36;}
.dayStatus{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;}
.dayPaid .dayStatus{background:#bdf0d1;color:#0a6b34;}
.dayUnpaid .dayStatus{background:#f8c9c9;color:#a11414;}
.dayPartial .dayStatus{background:#ffe082;color:#8a6100;}
.dayFree .dayStatus{background:#dbe6ff;color:#0047ff;}
.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 14px 14px;font-size:11px;color:#5a6270;}
.legendDot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;}
.dotGreen{background:#22c55e;}
.dotRed{background:#ef4444;}
.dotYellow{background:#f5c518;}
.dotBlue{background:#3b82f6;}
.dailySummary{padding:12px 14px 4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1f29;white-space:pre-line;border-top:1px solid #eef1f5;}

#reportBottom{margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding-bottom:18px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;}
th{background:#001f5b;color:#fff;padding:12px;}
td{padding:12px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;}
.footer{text-align:center;font-size:10px;margin-top:14px;opacity:.85}

.iosHint{display:none;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff8e1;border:1px solid #ffe0a3;border-radius:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5a4300;}

.modalOverlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,20,40,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);z-index:999;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:20px;}
.modalOverlay.open{display:flex;}
.modalCard{width:100%;max-width:380px;max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:24px 20px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);position:relative;animation:popIn .22s ease;}
@keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9) translateY(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1) translateY(0);}}
.modalTitle{text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#001f5b;margin-bottom:4px;}
.modalSub{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#8a93a3;margin-bottom:18px;}
.contactItem{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:16px;background:#f6f8fb;margin-bottom:10px;}
.contactIcon{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;}
.contactInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.contactName{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a1f29;}
.contactPhone{font-size:13px;color:#4a5568;margin-top:2px;}
.contactPhone a{color:#0047ff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;}
.ci-x{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffdede,#ffbcbc);}
.ci-car{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dbeafe,#bfdbfe);}
.ci-burger{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);}
.ci-person{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e0e7ff,#c7d2fe);}
.modalClose{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#f0f2f6;border:none;font-size:16px;color:#5a6270;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1),background .15s ease;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.modalClose:active{transform:scale(.82) rotate(90deg);background:#e2e6ec;}

.modalUpdateBtn{position:absolute;top:14px;right:54px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#eef4ff;border:none;color:#0047ff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .15s ease,background .15s ease;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;touch-action:none;}
.modalUpdateBtn:active{transform:scale(.88);background:#dbe6ff;}
.modalUpdateBtn.holding{background:#dbe6ff;}
.modalUpdateBtn .updateBtnIcon{position:relative;z-index:2;font-size:13px;pointer-events:none;}
.modalUpdateBtn .updateBtnIcon.spinning{animation:pullSpin .5s linear infinite;}
.modalUpdateBtn.holding .updateBtnIcon{animation:updateBtnPulse .55s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes updateBtnPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.18);}}
.updateBtnRing{position:absolute;inset:0;width:30px;height:30px;pointer-events:none;transform:rotate(-90deg);}
.updateBtnRing circle{fill:none;stroke-width:2.6px;}
.updateBtnRingBg{stroke:rgba(0,71,255,.15);}
.updateBtnRingFg{stroke:#0047ff;stroke-dasharray:75.4;stroke-dashoffset:75.4;}

.settingsOpenBtn{width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:16px;border:1.5px dashed #c9d3e0;background:#fff;color:#2a2f36;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;transition:background .15s ease;}
.settingsOpenBtn:active{background:#f3f6fb;}
#settingsModal .modalCard{max-width:400px;max-height:86vh;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.settingsSection{margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.settingsSectionTitle{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#1a1f29;margin-bottom:10px;}
.billingModeRow{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.billingModeOpt{flex:1;min-width:0;width:auto;background:#f6f8fb;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;margin-top:0;color:inherit;}
.billingModeOpt:active{background:#eef2f7;}
.billingModeOpt.active{background:#eef4ff;border-color:#0047ff;}
.billingModeIcon{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.billingModeName{font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;color:#1a1f29;}
.billingModeDesc{font-size:10.5px;color:#8a93a3;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;}
.billingModeOpt.active .billingModeName{color:#0047ff;}
.settingsBackupText{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:110px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ec;background:#f9fbfd;resize:vertical;}
.settingsBackupHint{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#5a6270;min-height:15px;text-align:center;}
.settingsSectionDesc{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#8a93a3;margin:-4px 0 10px;line-height:1.4;}
.authModeRow{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.authModeOpt{flex:1;min-width:0;width:auto;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;background:#f6f8fb;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a93a3;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease,color .15s ease;margin-top:0;}
.authModeOpt:active{background:#eef2f7;}
.authModeOpt.active{background:#eef4ff;border-color:#0047ff;color:#0047ff;}
.accountServerLink{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 12px;margin:0 0 12px;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid #e2e6ec;background:#f9fbfd;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;text-align:left;box-sizing:border-box;}
.accountServerLink:active{background:#eef2f7;}
.accountServerLinkIcon{font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;}
.accountServerLinkInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;}
.accountServerLinkLabel{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#9aa3b0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px;}
.accountServerLinkText{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2030;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.accountServerLinkChev{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0047ff;flex-shrink:0;white-space:nowrap;}
.serverProfileList{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.serverProfileItem{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;padding:10px 11px;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;background:#f6f8fb;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;}
.serverProfileItem.active{border-color:#0047ff;background:#eef4ff;}
.serverProfileTop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.serverProfileDot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#c7cdd6;flex:0 0 auto;transition:background .2s ease;}
.serverProfileDot.ok{background:#0a9a4a;}
.serverProfileDot.err{background:#c62828;}
.serverProfileDot.pending{background:#f0a500;animation:serverDotPulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes serverDotPulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.35;}}
.serverProfileInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.serverProfileName{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#1a2030;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.serverProfileUrl{font-size:10.5px;color:#8a93a3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-top:1px;}
.serverProfileBottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;}
.serverProfilePing{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#5a6270;min-height:13px;flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}
.serverProfileActions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;flex:0 0 auto;}
.serverProfileIconBtn{width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #e2e6ec;background:#fff;font-size:12.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;padding:0;margin-top:0;font-family:inherit;flex:0 0 auto;}
.serverProfileIconBtn:active{background:#eef2f7;}
.serverProfileUseBtn{width:auto;padding:7px 11px;margin-top:0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #0047ff;color:#0047ff;background:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;font-family:inherit;flex:0 0 auto;}
.serverProfileUseBtn.active{background:#0047ff;color:#fff;}
.serverQuickAddRow{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.serverQuickAddBtn{width:auto;flex:1;min-width:88px;padding:9px 6px;margin-top:0;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed #c9d3e6;background:#fff;color:#5a6270;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;}
.serverQuickAddBtn:active{background:#f6f8fb;}
.serverEditBox{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:14px;background:#f6f8fb;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;}
.serverEmptyHint{font-size:11.5px;color:#8a93a3;text-align:center;padding:6px 0;}
@keyframes btnSuccessPulse{0%{transform:scale(1);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(10,154,74,.5);}35%{transform:scale(1.045);box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(10,154,74,.16);}100%{transform:scale(1);box-shadow:0 0 0 15px rgba(10,154,74,0);}}
.btnSuccessFlash{animation:btnSuccessPulse .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.updateAppBtn{border-color:#c9d9ff;color:#0047ff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,71,255,.1);}
.updateAppBtn:active{background:#eef4ff;}
.updateAppBtn .historyClearFill{background:#0047ff;}
#updateOverlay{z-index:1002;}
.updateAnimBox{text-align:center;}
.updateRing{width:88px;height:88px;margin:0 auto 18px;border-radius:50%;border:5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-top-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;animation:updateSpin .9s linear infinite;}
@keyframes updateSpin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.updateAnimText{font-weight:800;font-size:16px;color:#fff;margin-top:2px;}
.updateAnimSub{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);margin-top:6px;}
.pullRefreshIndicator{height:56px;margin-top:-56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0047ff;}
.pullRefreshIndicator .spinning{display:inline-block;animation:pullSpin .7s linear infinite;}
@keyframes pullSpin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}

#rentModal,#completeRentModal,#deleteMonthModal,#notifyModal{z-index:1000;}
.rentFormRow{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.rentFormRow input{flex:1;min-width:0;}

#confirmModal{z-index:1001;}
#confirmModal .modalCard{max-width:320px;text-align:center;}
.confirmIcon{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:6px;animation:confirmPop .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
@keyframes confirmPop{0%{transform:scale(.4) rotate(0deg);opacity:0;}55%{transform:scale(1.18) rotate(-10deg);opacity:1;}75%{transform:scale(.94) rotate(6deg);}100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0deg);}}
.confirmDangerBtn{background:#c62828;}
.confirmDangerBtn:active{background:#a11414;}

.topBar{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;flex:0 0 auto;}
.gearBtn{position:absolute;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:#f1f4f8;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .15s ease,transform .15s ease;}
.gearBtn:active{background:#e2e8f0;transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92);}

.navBtn{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1);width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff,#eef2f9);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(10,30,70,.12),0 1px 3px rgba(10,30,70,.07),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.6);color:#001f5b;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .38s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1),box-shadow .25s ease;font-family:inherit;overflow:hidden;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.navBtn:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.86);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(10,30,70,.14),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.6);}
.navBtnLeft{left:0;}
.navBtnRight{right:0;}
.navBtnArrow{width:10px;height:10px;border-top:2.6px solid #0047ff;border-right:2.6px solid #0047ff;border-radius:1.5px;pointer-events:none;transition:border-color .2s ease;}
.navBtnLeft .navBtnArrow{transform:rotate(-135deg);margin-left:4px;}
.navBtnRight .navBtnArrow{transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:4px;}
.navBtn:active .navBtnArrow{border-color:#001f5b;}
.navBtnRippleFx{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,71,255,.32) 0%,rgba(0,71,255,0) 70%);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.navBtnRippleFx.animate{animation:navBtnRipple .5s ease-out;}
@keyframes navBtnRipple{0%{opacity:.7;transform:scale(.25);}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.9);}}

.carPickerBtn{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:13px 14px;margin:6px 0 12px 0;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e2e6ec;background:#f9fbfd;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;text-align:left;box-sizing:border-box;transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease;}
.carPickerBtn:active{background:#f0f3f7;}
.carPickerBtn .placeholder{color:#9aa3b0;font-weight:500;}
.carPickerBtn .carPickerChosen{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;}
.carPickerBtn .carEmoji{font-size:19px;flex-shrink:0;}
.carPickerBtn .carPickerText{min-width:0;}
.carPickerBtn .carPickerName{font-weight:700;color:#1a1f29;font-size:14.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.carPickerBtn .carPickerPrice{font-weight:500;color:#7a8494;font-size:12px;margin-top:1px;}
.carPickerBtn .chev{color:#9aa3b0;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0;}

.carListWrap{max-height:52vh;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;touch-action:pan-y;margin:-4px 0 4px;}
.page2Panel .carListWrap{max-height:none;overflow:visible;}
.carItem{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:#f6f8fb;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .12s ease;border:1.5px solid transparent;}
.carItem:active{background:#eef2f7;}
.carItem.selected{border-color:#0047ff;background:#eef4ff;}
.carItemEmoji{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:#eef1f5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;}
.carItemInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.carItemName{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a1f29;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.carItemPrice{font-size:12.5px;color:#7a8494;margin-top:1px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.carEmptyState{text-align:center;color:#9aa3b0;font-size:13px;padding:24px 10px;}

.carSettingsRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.carSettingsRow input{margin:0;padding:10px 12px;font-size:16px;border-radius:12px;}
.carNameWrap{position:relative;flex:1.4;min-width:0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#f9fbfd;}
.carEditName{width:100%;position:relative;z-index:1;background:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;}
.carNameFill{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ef4444 0%,#f5c518 50%,#22c55e 100%);
clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0);transition:clip-path 1s linear,opacity .3s ease;}
.carNameFill.active{opacity:.4;}
.carEditPrice{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.carDeleteBtn{flex-shrink:0;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;border:none;background:#fdeaea;color:#c62828;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.carDeleteBtn:active{background:#f8c9c9;}
.carRentOpenBtn{width:100%;margin-top:9px;padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #0a8f4d;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#18c96a,#0a9f52);color:#fff;border-radius:13px;font-size:14px;font-weight:850;box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(24,201,106,.22);transition:transform .12s ease,filter .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease;}
.carRentOpenBtn:active{transform:scale(.98);filter:brightness(.96);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(24,201,106,.18);}
.page2HeaderBtns{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0;}
.carAddTopBtn{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:#0047ff;color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s ease,transform .1s ease;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,71,255,.35);}
.carAddTopBtn:active{background:#0038cc;transform:scale(.94);}
.notifyBellBtn{position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#fff;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s ease,transform .1s ease;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.notifyBellBtn:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transform:scale(.94);}
.notifyBellBtn.ring .notifyBellIcon{animation:notifyBellRing .5s ease;}
@keyframes notifyBellRing{0%,100%{transform:rotate(0);}20%{transform:rotate(-18deg);}40%{transform:rotate(16deg);}60%{transform:rotate(-10deg);}80%{transform:rotate(6deg);}}
.notifyBellBadge{position:absolute;top:-3px;right:-3px;min-width:16px;height:16px;padding:0 4px;border-radius:9px;background:#ff3b30;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #001f5b;}

.historyHandle{position:fixed;left:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:6px;height:64px;background:#0047ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;opacity:.35;z-index:900;transition:opacity .2s ease;}
.historyOverlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,12,28,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);z-index:998;}
.historyOverlay.open{display:block;}
.historyDrawer{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:95%;max-width:460px;background:#f6f8fc;z-index:999;box-shadow:16px 0 46px rgba(0,10,40,.28);border-radius:0 28px 28px 0;overflow:hidden;transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.historyDrawer.open{transform:translateX(0);}
.historyDrawer.dragging{transition:none;will-change:transform;}

.historyHeader{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#001f5b 0%,#0047a8 100%);padding:calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 20px 20px;flex-shrink:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.historyHeader::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:170px;height:170px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:50%;top:-95px;right:-55px;pointer-events:none;}
.historyHeaderTop{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.historyTitle{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.2px;}
.historySubtitle{font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;}
.historyCloseBtn{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:none;font-size:14px;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s ease,transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.historyCloseBtn:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.32);transform:scale(.82) rotate(90deg);}

.historyList{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;touch-action:pan-y;padding:16px 14px calc(6px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));}
.historyItem{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 40px 14px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;position:relative;z-index:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,box-shadow .12s ease;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(20,30,60,.06);border:1px solid #eef1f6;}
.historyItem:active{transform:scale(.98);background:#fbfcfe;}
.historyItem.holding{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,71,255,.28);}
.historyItemFill{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;border-radius:18px;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,71,255,.16),rgba(0,71,255,.34));
clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0);}
.historyItemRow{display:flex;gap:12px;}
.historyAvatar{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf0ff,#dbe6ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;flex-shrink:0;}
.historyItemMain{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.historyItemTop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;}
.historyItemCar{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;color:#12203c;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.historyItemSum{font-weight:800;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;color:#0047ff;}
.historyItemSum.sumPaid{color:#0a9a4a;}
.historyItemDate{font-size:11.5px;color:#8a93a3;margin-top:3px;font-weight:600;}
.historyItemChips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;}
.historyChip{background:#f1f4f9;color:#5a6270;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap;}
.chipAccent{background:#e6edff;color:#0047ff;}
.chipToday{background:#e7f9ee;color:#0a6b34;}
.historyItemWhen{font-size:10px;color:#c1c7d1;margin-top:8px;font-weight:600;}
.historyDeleteBtn{position:absolute;top:12px;right:10px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:transparent;color:#c7cdd7;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease;}
.historyDeleteBtn:active{background:#fdeaea;color:#c62828;}
.historyClearBtn{position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:block;width:fit-content;margin:4px auto 16px;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #f6cfcf;background:#fff;color:#c62828;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,transform .1s ease,box-shadow .15s ease;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;touch-action:none;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(198,40,40,.08);}
.historyClearBtn:active{background:#fdeaea;transform:scale(.96);}
.historyClearBtn.holding{color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(198,40,40,.25);}
.historyClearFill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:0%;background:#c62828;z-index:0;}
.historyClearLabelText{position:relative;z-index:1;}
.historyEmpty{text-align:center;color:#9aa3b0;font-size:13px;padding:54px 20px;}
.historyDayFolder{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .12s ease;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(20,30,60,.06);border:1px solid #eef1f6;}
.historyDayFolder:active{transform:scale(.98);background:#fbfcfe;}
.historyDayFolderIcon{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf0ff,#dbe6ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;flex-shrink:0;}
.historyDayFolderInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.historyDayFolderDate{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;color:#1a2136;text-transform:capitalize;}
.historyDayFolderCount{font-size:11.5px;color:#8a93a3;margin-top:2px;font-weight:600;}
.historyDayFolderSum{font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:#0a9a4a;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;}
.historyDayBackRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.historyDayBackBtn{width:auto;flex-shrink:0;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:none;background:#eef2f7;color:#1a2136;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .15s ease;}
.historyDayBackBtn:active{background:#e0e5ec;}
.historyDayBackTitle{font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:#1a2136;text-transform:capitalize;}
.historyEmptyIcon{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;opacity:.65;}

.notifyItem{display:flex;gap:11px;background:#f6f8fb;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 13px;margin-bottom:9px;border:1.5px solid transparent;position:relative;}
.notifyItem.unread{background:#eef4ff;border-color:#d3e2ff;}
.notifyItem.unread::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:14px;right:12px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#0047ff;}
.notifyIcon{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(20,30,60,.06);}
.notifyItem.unread .notifyIcon{background:#fff;}
.notifyBody{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.notifyTitle{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#1a2136;}
.notifyDesc{font-size:12px;color:#5a6270;margin-top:2px;}
.notifySum{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#0047ff;margin-top:4px;}
.notifySum.sumDone{color:#0a9a4a;}
.notifyTime{font-size:10.5px;color:#9aa3b0;margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;}
.notifyEmpty{text-align:center;color:#9aa3b0;font-size:13px;padding:34px 20px;}

.exportSquare,.exportSquare *{border-radius:0 !important;}
.exportSquare #reportBottom{padding-bottom:40px;}
.exportSquare .footer{
position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;
display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;
height:40px;background:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;font-size:11px;
}

.page2Handle{position:fixed;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:6px;height:64px;background:#6a1b9a;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;opacity:.35;z-index:900;transition:opacity .2s ease;}
.page2Overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,12,28,.55);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);z-index:998;}
.page2Overlay.open{display:block;}
.page2Drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:95%;max-width:460px;background:#f6f8fc;z-index:999;box-shadow:-16px 0 46px rgba(0,10,40,.28);border-radius:28px 0 0 28px;overflow:hidden;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.page2Drawer.open{transform:translateX(0);}
.page2Drawer.dragging{transition:none;will-change:transform;}

.page2Header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#001f5b 0%,#3d2b7a 100%);padding:calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 20px 18px;flex-shrink:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.page2Header::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:170px;height:170px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:50%;top:-95px;left:-55px;pointer-events:none;}
.page2HeaderTop{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.page2Title{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:.2px;}
.page2Subtitle{font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;}
.page2CloseBtn{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:none;font-size:14px;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s ease,transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.page2CloseBtn:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.32);transform:scale(.82) rotate(90deg);}

.page2Tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:14px 14px 0;flex-shrink:0;background:#f6f8fc;position:relative;}
.page2TabIndicator{position:absolute;top:14px;bottom:0;border-radius:14px;background:#001f5b;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(0,31,91,.28);transition:left .34s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1),width .34s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);z-index:0;pointer-events:none;}
.page2Tab{flex:1;padding:10px 4px;border:none;background:transparent;color:#7a8494;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;transition:color .2s ease;position:relative;z-index:1;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.page2Tab .tabIcon{font-size:16px;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.page2Tab.active{color:#fff;}
.page2Tab.active .tabIcon{transform:scale(1.12);}
.page2Content{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;touch-action:pan-y;padding:16px 14px calc(6px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));}
.page2Panel{display:none;}
.page2Panel.active{display:block;animation:page2FadeIn .18s ease;}
@keyframes page2FadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.page2Hint{text-align:center;color:#b7bec9;font-size:11px;padding:10px 16px 16px;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:600;}


/* Long-press edit interaction: 1.5s visual loading */
.carHoldOverlay{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:20;border-radius:inherit;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .18s ease,visibility .18s ease;background:rgba(255,255,255,.34);backdrop-filter:blur(1.5px);}
.carHoldOverlayFill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(24,201,106,.10),rgba(24,201,106,.24),rgba(0,71,255,.14));transition:none;}
.carHoldOverlayFill::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:-80px;width:80px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.72),transparent);filter:blur(5px);animation:carHoldShimmer .62s linear infinite;}
.carHoldLabel{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.92);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(15,27,42,.82);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.1px;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,27,42,.18);opacity:0;transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .22s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.carManageCard.carHolding{transform:scale(.985);border-color:#4bd58c!important;box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(24,201,106,.20),0 0 0 2px rgba(24,201,106,.12)!important;}
.carManageCard.carHolding .carHoldOverlay{opacity:1;visibility:visible;}
.carManageCard.carHolding .carHoldLabel{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);}
.carManageCard.carHolding .carHoldOverlayFill{animation:carHoldFill 1.5s linear forwards;}
.carManageCard.carHoldOpening{animation:carHoldOpen .42s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
@keyframes carHoldFill{from{width:0%;}to{width:100%;}}
@keyframes carHoldShimmer{from{transform:translateX(-100px);}to{transform:translateX(180px);}}
@keyframes carHoldOpen{0%{transform:scale(.985);box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(24,201,106,.20),0 0 0 2px rgba(24,201,106,.12);}55%{transform:scale(1.012);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,71,255,.18),0 0 0 5px rgba(0,71,255,.10);}100%{transform:scale(1);}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.carHoldOverlayFill,.carHoldOverlayFill::after,.carManageCard.carHolding,.carManageCard.carHoldOpening{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;}}

.carManageCard{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:12px 12px 4px;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid #eef1f6;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(20,30,60,.05);transition:box-shadow .3s ease,border-color .3s ease;}
@keyframes carCardNewPop{0%{transform:scale(.93);opacity:0;}60%{transform:scale(1.015);opacity:1;}100%{transform:scale(1);}}
.carCardNewFlash{animation:carCardNewPop .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);border-color:#0047ff;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,71,255,.18);}
.carManageCard .carSettingsRow{margin-bottom:8px;}


/* ===== XCAR PRO UI additions ===== */
.page2HeaderBtns{gap:7px;}
.carAddTopBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#19c968,#0a9f4b)!important;color:#fff!important;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24)!important;box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(16,185,89,.30)!important;font-weight:900;}
.carAddTopBtn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06);transform:translateY(-1px);}
.page2QuickBtn{width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#eef3fa,#dbe4f0);color:#17304d;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(15,35,60,.13);cursor:pointer;}
.page2QuickBtn:active{transform:scale(.94);}
.serverRefreshBtn{position:relative;}
.serverRefreshBtn.busy .serverRefreshIcon{animation:serverSpin .7s linear infinite;}
@keyframes serverSpin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.fleetViewSwitch{display:none!important;}
.cardViewMenu{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;background:rgba(7,18,31,.48);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);z-index:1100;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;}
.cardViewMenu.open{display:flex;}
.cardViewMenuCard{width:min(430px,100%);background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.28);}
.cardViewMenuTitle{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:#15263a;margin-bottom:12px;}
.cardViewMenuGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;}
.cardViewMenuBtn{border:1px solid #dfe6ef;background:#f7f9fc;border-radius:16px;padding:13px 7px;min-height:78px;font-weight:800;color:#22344a;cursor:pointer;}
.cardViewMenuBtn span{display:block;font-size:23px;margin-bottom:5px;}
.cardViewMenuBtn.active{border-color:#15b95b;background:#eafaf1;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(21,185,91,.13);}
.notesTopBtn{position:relative;}
.notesDot{position:absolute;right:5px;top:4px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#18c96a;display:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(24,201,106,.15);}
.notesDot.on{display:block;}
.notesModalGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:14px;}
.noteBox{min-height:92px;border:1px solid #dfe5ed;background:#f7f9fc;border-radius:16px;padding:10px;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:.18s ease;}
.noteBox:active{transform:scale(.97);}
.noteNum{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#718096;}
.noteText{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#172337;margin-top:7px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;max-height:55px;overflow:hidden;}
.noteEmpty{color:#a3adba;font-weight:600;}
.noteEditor{display:none;margin-top:12px;}
.noteEditor.open{display:block;}
.noteEditor textarea{width:100%;min-height:125px;resize:none;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #d8e0ea;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;font:600 14px system-ui;}
.noteEditorRow{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;}
.noteEditorRow button{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:11px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;}
.noteSave{background:#13b95b;color:#fff;}.noteCancel{background:#edf1f6;color:#26364a;}
.carManageCard{position:relative;}
.carReserveBtn{border:1px solid #dbe4ef;background:#f6f8fb;color:#506176;border-radius:10px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;}
.carReserveBtn.active{background:#fff4dc;border-color:#f0b84b;color:#a66a00;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(240,184,75,.18);}
.carStatusRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;}
.carStatusBadge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.2px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;}
.carStatusDot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}
.carStatusFree{color:#087a3d;background:#eafaf1;border-color:#bce8cf;}
.carStatusFree .carStatusDot{background:#16b85a;}
.carStatusRented{color:#a33f00;background:#fff3e8;border-color:#ffd1b0;}
.carStatusRented .carStatusDot{background:#f47a18;}
.carStatusReserved{color:#8b5d00;background:#fff7df;border-color:#f0d58c;}
.carStatusReserved .carStatusDot{background:#e5ad21;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carStatusFree{color:#b9f5d1;background:#0d3b25;border-color:#1c6841;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carStatusRented{color:#ffd1aa;background:#422515;border-color:#77472a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carStatusReserved{color:#ffe29a;background:#3c3014;border-color:#725d25;}
.carReserveBadge{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;color:#a66a00;background:#fff4dc;border:1px solid #f0cf86;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;}
.carEditLongHint{font-size:10px;color:#8c98a8;font-weight:700;margin-top:5px;}
.carEditModalCard{max-width:430px;}
.carEditLogoRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:12px 0 4px;}
.carLogoPreview{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:16px;background:#f0f3f7;border:1px solid #dbe2eb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;font-size:25px;flex:0 0 auto;}
.carLogoPreview img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;}
.carLogoBtn{border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#edf2f7;color:#26384d;padding:10px 12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;}
.carEditModalBtns{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;}.carEditModalBtns button{flex:1;}
.carReserveBtn{background:#f0b84b;color:#172337;border:1px solid #d99d20;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(240,184,75,.22);}
.carReserveBtn.active{background:#16a05a;color:#fff;border-color:#0b8146;box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(22,160,90,.24);}
.reserveToggle{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#f7f9fc;border:1px solid #e1e7ef;border-radius:14px;padding:11px 12px;margin-top:10px;font-weight:800;color:#293a4f;}
.reserveToggle input{accent-color:#f0b84b;width:18px;height:18px;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2QuickBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#18243a,#101a2c);color:#d9e4f7;box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .cardViewMenu{background:rgba(1,5,12,.72);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .cardViewMenuCard{background:#111b2c;border:1px solid #263750;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .cardViewMenuTitle{color:#f2f6fb;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .cardViewMenuBtn{background:#172238;border-color:#2b3b56;color:#e4ebf5;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .cardViewMenuBtn.active{background:#103523;border-color:#18c96a;color:#bdf5d2;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .noteBox,html[data-theme="dark"] .noteEditor textarea{background:#172238;border-color:#2b3b56;color:#e9eef6;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .noteText{color:#e9eef6;}.noteEmpty{color:#71809a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carReserveBtn{background:#2a2515;border-color:#8b6b1d;color:#ffe7a0;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carReserveBtn.active{background:#0d5f38;border-color:#15975a;color:#d9ffe9;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .reserveToggle{background:#172238;border-color:#2b3b56;color:#e4ebf5;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carRentOpenBtn{box-shadow:0 5px 16px rgba(24,201,106,.16);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carReserveBtn.active,html[data-theme="dark"] .carReserveBadge{background:#3a2c12;border-color:#735a24;color:#ffd879;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carLogoPreview{background:#172238;border-color:#2b3b56;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carLogoBtn{background:#1b2940;color:#e4ebf5;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .noteCancel{background:#1b2940;color:#e4ebf5;}
/* Serious dark theme: stronger hierarchy, less blue haze, cleaner surfaces */
html[data-theme="dark"] body{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% -10%,#18253a 0,#0a101b 38%,#060a11 100%);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .card{background:#0d1522;border:1px solid #1d2a3d;box-shadow:0 22px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Header{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#101b2d,#0a111e);border-bottom:1px solid #26364c;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Tabs{background:#0a111d;border-top:1px solid #1d2a3d;border-bottom:1px solid #1d2a3d;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Tab{color:#7e8da4;}.page2Tab.active{color:inherit;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Content{background:#09111d;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carManageCard,html[data-theme="dark"] .rentedCard,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyItem{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#121d2d,#0e1827);border-color:#24344a;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.22);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carNameWrap,html[data-theme="dark"] .carEditName,html[data-theme="dark"] .carEditPrice{background:#172337!important;color:#f1f5fb;border-color:#293b54;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carEditLongHint{color:#71819a;}

/* ---- переключатель вида карточек автопарка: сетка / список / текущий ---- */
.fleetViewSwitch{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:2px 0 12px;padding:4px;background:#eef1f6;border-radius:14px;}
.fleetViewOpt{flex:1;padding:8px 4px;border:none;background:transparent;border-radius:11px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8494;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .2s ease,color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;white-space:nowrap;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.fleetViewOpt.active{background:#fff;color:#0047ff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(20,30,60,.1);}

/* ---- фото/аватар машины — общий для всех трёх видов карточек ---- */
.carPhotoAvatar{position:relative;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf0ff,#dbe6ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.carPhotoAvatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
.carPhotoAvatar .carPhotoEmoji{font-size:20px;}
.carPhotoBtn{position:absolute;right:-3px;bottom:-3px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fff;background:#0047ff;color:#fff;font-size:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,71,255,.4);padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
.carManageCard.styleList .carPhotoAvatar{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;}
.carManageCard.styleList .carPhotoAvatar .carPhotoEmoji{font-size:17px;}
.carManageCard.styleList .carPhotoBtn{width:17px;height:17px;font-size:8px;}

/* ---- ПЛИТКА: сетка 2 колонки, крупное фото сверху ---- */
.carListWrap.viewTile{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;}
.carManageCard.styleTile{position:relative;padding:14px 10px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carPhotoAvatar{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:9px;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carPhotoAvatar .carPhotoEmoji{font-size:28px;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carTileName{text-align:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;padding:8px 8px;margin:0 0 6px;border-radius:10px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carTilePrice{text-align:center;font-size:16px;padding:8px 8px;margin:0 0 8px;border-radius:10px;color:#0047ff;font-weight:800;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .rentSwitch{border-top:none;padding:6px 0 0;justify-content:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .rentSwitchLabel{display:none;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carDeleteBtn{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;width:26px;height:26px;font-size:11px;background:#fdeaea;}
.carManageCard.styleTile .carRentSince{font-size:9.5px;margin-top:6px;}

/* ---- КОМПАКТ: плотная горизонтальная строка ---- */
.carManageCard.styleCompact{padding:9px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carPhotoAvatar{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carPhotoAvatar .carPhotoEmoji{font-size:16px;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carCompactInfo{flex:1;min-width:110px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carCompactName{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;margin:0;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carCompactPrice{font-size:16px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;margin:0;color:#7a8494;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .rentSwitch{border-top:none;padding:0;flex-shrink:0;width:auto;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .rentSwitchLabel{display:none;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .rentSwitchTrack{margin:0;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carDeleteBtn{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:12px;flex-shrink:0;}
.carManageCard.styleCompact .carRentSince{flex-basis:100%;font-size:9.5px;margin-top:2px;padding-left:48px;}

/* ---- ПРЕМИУМ: крупная визуальная карточка с фото, статусом и ценой ---- */
.carManageCard.stylePremium{position:relative;padding:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff,#f4f8fc);border:1px solid #e3eaf2;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(17,38,65,.10);transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .28s ease,border-color .28s ease;}
.carManageCard.stylePremium:active{transform:scale(.992);}
.premiumVisual{position:relative;height:170px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dce9f7,#edf4fb);}
.premiumVisual .carPhotoAvatar{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dce9f7,#f5f8fb);}
.premiumVisual .carPhotoAvatar img{object-fit:cover;}
.premiumVisual .carPhotoAvatar .carPhotoEmoji{font-size:62px;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12));}
.premiumVisual .carPhotoBtn{right:12px;bottom:12px;width:34px;height:34px;font-size:13px;border-width:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);color:#173b67;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.16);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.premiumShade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(4,16,30,.02) 25%,rgba(4,16,30,.58) 100%);pointer-events:none;}
.premiumTopBadge{position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);color:#173b67;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.4px;box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
.carManageCard.stylePremium .carDeleteBtn{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.72);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.14);z-index:3;}
.premiumBody{padding:14px 15px 12px;}
.premiumTitleRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;}
.carPremiumName{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:19px!important;font-weight:900!important;color:#12253b!important;background:#f5f8fb!important;border:1px solid #e9eef4!important;border-radius:13px!important;padding:10px 11px!important;}
.premiumPrice{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:3px;flex-shrink:0;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:13px;background:#eaf3ff;color:#0b4da2;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap;}
.carPremiumPrice{width:66px;border:0!important;background:transparent!important;padding:0!important;color:inherit!important;font-size:17px!important;font-weight:900!important;text-align:right;}
.premiumPrice small{font-size:9px;color:#6c7f95;font-weight:800;}
.premiumMeta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:9px 1px 0;color:#7b8999;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;}
.carManageCard.stylePremium .rentSwitch{margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5;padding:10px 2px 4px;}
.carManageCard.stylePremium .carRentSince{margin:5px 2px 0;font-size:10px;}

html[data-theme="dark"] .carManageCard.stylePremium{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#132033,#0d1725);border-color:#26384f;box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.32);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .premiumVisual,.html[data-theme="dark"] .premiumVisual .carPhotoAvatar{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b2b40,#101a29);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carPremiumName{background:#18263a!important;border-color:#2b3d55!important;color:#f1f5fb!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .premiumPrice{background:#172b45;color:#8fc0ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .premiumPrice small,.html[data-theme="dark"] .premiumMeta{color:#8193a9;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carManageCard.stylePremium .rentSwitch{border-top-color:#26364b;}

.rentSwitch{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px;color:#5a6270;font-weight:700;padding:9px 2px 10px;cursor:pointer;border-top:1px dashed #eef1f6;}
.rentSwitch input{display:none;}
.rentSwitchTrack{width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:20px;background:#e2e6ec;position:relative;transition:background .2s ease;flex-shrink:0;}
.rentSwitchThumb{position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .2s ease;}
.rentSwitch input:checked ~ .rentSwitchTrack{background:#0047ff;}
.rentSwitch input:checked ~ .rentSwitchTrack .rentSwitchThumb{transform:translateX(16px);}
.carRentSince{font-size:11px;color:#9aa3b0;margin:-2px 2px 8px;font-weight:600;}

.rentedCard{display:block;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eef1f6;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(20,30,60,.05);}
.rentedCardTop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
.rentedCardInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.carReturnBtn{width:auto;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:0;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:none;background:#e7f9ee;color:#0a6b34;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .15s ease;}
.carReturnBtn:active{background:#bdf0d1;}
.rentedAccruedBig{margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4ff,#e3ecff);border-radius:13px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0047ff;}
.rentedAccruedBig span{display:block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7a8494;margin-top:1px;}

/* ---------- красивые "папки" в настройках (аккордеон) ---------- */
.settingsFolder{background:#f6f8fb;border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;}
.settingsFolder.open{border-color:#d6e2ff;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,71,255,.07);}
.settingsFolderHeader{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 14px;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;user-select:none;}
.settingsFolderHeader:active{background:rgba(0,0,0,.02);}
.settingsFolderIconBadge{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf0ff,#dbe6ff);transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.settingsFolder.open .settingsFolderIconBadge{transform:scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);}
.settingsFolderHeaderText{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.settingsFolderTitle{font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px;color:#1a1f29;}
.settingsFolderHint{font-size:10.5px;color:#8a93a3;margin-top:2px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.settingsFolderChev{color:#9aa3b0;font-size:11px;flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.settingsFolder.open .settingsFolderChev{transform:rotate(180deg);color:#0047ff;}
.settingsFolderBody{display:none;padding:0 14px 16px;}
.settingsFolder.open .settingsFolderBody{display:block;animation:page2FadeIn .22s ease;}
.settingsFolderBody .settingsSectionDesc{margin-top:0;}

/* ---------- автообновление данных (интервал ползунком) ---------- */
.autoSyncIntervalRow{margin-top:12px;transition:opacity .2s ease;}
.autoSyncIntervalRow.disabled{opacity:.4;pointer-events:none;}
.autoSyncIntervalLabel{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#2a2f36;margin-bottom:8px;}
.autoSyncIntervalLabel b{color:#0047ff;font-size:14px;}
.autoSyncSlider{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#e2e6ec;outline:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
.autoSyncSlider::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#0047ff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,71,255,.4);cursor:pointer;border:3px solid #fff;}
.autoSyncSlider::-moz-range-thumb{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#0047ff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,71,255,.4);cursor:pointer;border:3px solid #fff;}
.autoSyncIntervalScale{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;color:#9aa3b0;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px;}

/* ---------- переключатель темы ---------- */
.themeOptRow{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.themeOpt{flex:1;min-width:0;width:auto;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;margin-top:0;color:inherit;}
.themeOpt:active{background:#f3f6fb;}
.themeOpt.active{background:#eef4ff;border-color:#0047ff;}
.themeOptIcon{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.themeOptName{font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;color:#1a1f29;}
.themeOpt.active .themeOptName{color:#0047ff;}

/* ---------- подписка ---------- */
.subscriptionCard{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff8e1,#ffedb3);border:1.5px solid #ffe0a3;transition:transform .12s ease;}
.subscriptionCard:active{transform:scale(.98);}
.subscriptionCard.expired{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fdeaea,#f8c9c9);border-color:#f3a5a5;}
.subscriptionCardIcon{font-size:26px;flex-shrink:0;}
.subscriptionCardInfo{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.subscriptionCardDays{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;color:#8a6100;}
.subscriptionCard.expired .subscriptionCardDays{color:#a11414;}
.subscriptionCardHint{font-size:11px;color:#8a7440;margin-top:2px;font-weight:600;}
.subscriptionCard.expired .subscriptionCardHint{color:#a15c5c;}
.subscriptionCardChev{color:#9a8140;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0;}
.subscriptionCard.expired .subscriptionCardChev{color:#a15c5c;}
.subReqRow{display:flex;gap:10px;}
.subReqRow input{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.subQrWrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:12px 0 4px;}
.subQrWrap canvas{border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #eef1f6;background:#fff;padding:8px;}
.subRequisites{background:#f6f8fb;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 14px;margin:8px 0 14px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2a2f36;}
.subRequisites b{color:#1a1f29;}

/* ---------- чёрный список ---------- */
.blacklistOpenBtn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;}
.blacklistOpenBtn .blHint{font-weight:500;color:#9aa3b0;font-size:10.5px;}
.blacklistResultItem{padding:12px 13px;border-radius:14px;background:#fdeaea;border:1px solid #f6cfcf;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a1f1f;}
.blacklistResultItem b{color:#a11414;}
.blacklistClean{padding:16px 14px;border-radius:14px;background:#e7f9ee;border:1px solid #bdf0d1;color:#0a6b34;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;text-align:center;}

/* ---------- авторизация: покрасивее ---------- */
.authStandaloneModal{max-width:460px!important;}
.authStandaloneCard{margin-top:8px;}
.authStandaloneModal .modalTitle .x{color:#e53935;}
.authStandaloneModal .modalTitle .f{color:#18324b;}
.standaloneAccountState{margin-top:8px;padding:0 2px;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .authStandaloneModal .modalTitle .f{color:#e7ebf3;}
.authCard{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 14px 6px;border:1.5px solid #eef1f6;margin-bottom:6px;}
.authCardHeader{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.authCardIcon{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf0ff,#dbe6ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;}
.authCardTitle{font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;color:#1a1f29;}
.authCardSub{font-size:10.5px;color:#8a93a3;font-weight:600;margin-top:1px;}
.authModeRow{background:#f0f2f6;padding:4px;border-radius:14px;}
.authModeOpt{background:transparent;border:none;}
.authModeOpt.active{background:#fff;border-color:transparent;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}

/* ---------- тёмная тема ---------- */
html[data-theme="dark"] body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0e18,#070b13);color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .card{background:#121a2b;box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
html[data-theme="dark"] input,html[data-theme="dark"] select,html[data-theme="dark"] textarea{background:#1a2338;border-color:#26314a;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] input::placeholder,html[data-theme="dark"] textarea::placeholder{color:#5c6784;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .label{color:#c7cedd;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalCard{background:#121a2b;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalTitle{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalSub{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalClose{background:#1a2338;color:#c7cedd;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalClose:active{background:#26314a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalUpdateBtn{background:#1c2c52;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .modalUpdateBtn:active,html[data-theme="dark"] .modalUpdateBtn.holding{background:#26314a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .updateBtnRingBg{stroke:rgba(122,162,255,.2);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .updateBtnRingFg{stroke:#7aa2ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsFolder{background:#141d31;border-color:#232e48;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsFolder.open{border-color:#2f4372;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsFolderTitle{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsFolderHint,html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsSectionDesc,html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsBackupHint{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .billingModeOpt,html[data-theme="dark"] .serverProfileItem,html[data-theme="dark"] .authModeOpt,html[data-theme="dark"] .serverQuickAddBtn,html[data-theme="dark"] .serverEditBox,html[data-theme="dark"] .themeOpt,html[data-theme="dark"] .authCard,html[data-theme="dark"] .accountServerLink{background:#1a2338;border-color:#26314a;color:#c7cedd;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .accountServerLinkText{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .accountServerLinkLabel{color:#5c6784;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .authModeRow{background:#141d31;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .authModeOpt.active{background:#26314a;box-shadow:none;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .billingModeOpt.active,html[data-theme="dark"] .themeOpt.active{background:#1c2c52;border-color:#3b63ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .billingModeName,html[data-theme="dark"] .themeOptName,html[data-theme="dark"] .serverProfileName,html[data-theme="dark"] .authCardTitle{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .serverProfileUrl,html[data-theme="dark"] .serverEmptyHint,html[data-theme="dark"] .authCardSub{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDrawer,html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Drawer{background:#0d1424;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .historyItem,html[data-theme="dark"] .carManageCard,html[data-theme="dark"] .rentedCard,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDayFolder,html[data-theme="dark"] .carItem{background:#141d31;border-color:#232e48;box-shadow:none;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .historyItemCar,html[data-theme="dark"] .carItemName,html[data-theme="dark"] .carEditName,html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Tab.active,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDayFolderDate,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDayBackTitle{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carEditName{background:transparent;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carNameWrap{background:#1a2338;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .result,html[data-theme="dark"] .dailySummary{background:#1a2338;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] table,html[data-theme="dark"] #reportBottom,html[data-theme="dark"] #dailyBreakdown{background:#121a2b;}
html[data-theme="dark"] th{background:#0d1424;}
html[data-theme="dark"] td{border-color:#232e48;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .footer{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carPickerBtn{background:#1a2338;border-color:#26314a;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .gearBtn,html[data-theme="dark"] .navBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1a2338,#121a2b);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);color:#c7d3ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .settingsOpenBtn{background:#121a2b;border-color:#26314a;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .rentSwitchTrack{background:#26314a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .autoSyncSlider{background:#26314a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .autoSyncIntervalLabel{color:#c7cedd;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .autoSyncIntervalScale{color:#5c6784;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Tabs{background:#0d1424;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carRentSince,html[data-theme="dark"] .contactPhone,html[data-theme="dark"] .billingModeDesc,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyItemDate,html[data-theme="dark"] .carItemPrice,html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDayFolderCount,html[data-theme="dark"] .page2Subtitle,html[data-theme="dark"] .historySubtitle{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .contactItem{background:#1a2338;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .contactName{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .historyDayBackBtn{background:#26314a;color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .subRequisites{background:#1a2338;color:#c7cedd;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .subRequisites b{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .subQrWrap canvas{background:#fff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .blacklistClean{background:#0f2a1c;border-color:#1f5c3c;color:#4ade80;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .blacklistResultItem{background:#2a1414;border-color:#5c2323;color:#f87171;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .fleetViewSwitch{background:#141d31;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .fleetViewOpt{color:#8b93a7;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .fleetViewOpt.active{background:#1c2c52;color:#7aa2ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .carPhotoAvatar{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a2338,#121a2b);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyItem{background:#141d31;border-color:#232e48;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyItem.unread{background:#1c2c52;border-color:#3b63ff;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyIcon{background:#0d1424;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyTitle{color:#e7ebf3;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyDesc,html[data-theme="dark"] .notifyTime{color:#8b93a7;}

/* ===== XCAR MOTION / PREMIUM UI ===== */
:root{--motion-fast:140ms;--motion:220ms;--motion-slow:360ms;--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.25,1);--ease-spring:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}
body{transition:background .45s var(--ease),color .3s var(--ease);}
.card{transition:box-shadow .35s var(--ease),background .35s var(--ease),transform .35s var(--ease);}
button,.b1,.b7,.b3,.settingsOpenBtn,.navBtn,.modalClose,.updateBtn,.quickActionBtn{transition:transform var(--motion-fast) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--motion) var(--ease),filter var(--motion) var(--ease),background-color var(--motion) var(--ease),opacity var(--motion) var(--ease);will-change:transform;}
button:hover{filter:brightness(1.035);box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.10);}
button:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(.975)!important;filter:brightness(.98);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
input,select,textarea{transition:border-color var(--motion) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--motion) var(--ease),background-color var(--motion) var(--ease),transform var(--motion-fast) var(--ease);}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(0,200,83,.13),0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.06);}
.calculatorScroll{scroll-behavior:auto;}
/* Avoid animating every calculator field on each render/scroll. */
.calculatorScroll>*{animation:none!important;}
@keyframes contentRise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(9px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes softIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px) scale(.985)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1)}}
@keyframes softOut{to{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px) scale(.985)}}
@keyframes pulseSoft{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.035)}}
@keyframes rippleWave{from{transform:scale(0);opacity:.32}to{transform:scale(2.8);opacity:0}}
.ripple-wave{position:absolute;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;pointer-events:none;transform:scale(0);animation:rippleWave .55s var(--ease) forwards;opacity:.22;z-index:20;}
button,.navBtn,.modalClose{position:relative;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;}
/* карточки: плавное поднятие и появление */
.carCard,.autoCard,.rentalCard,.historyCard,.noteCard,.fleetCard,.listCard,.settingsFolder,.contactItem{transition:transform var(--motion) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--motion) var(--ease),border-color var(--motion) var(--ease),background-color var(--motion) var(--ease),opacity var(--motion) var(--ease);}
.carCard:hover,.autoCard:hover,.rentalCard:hover,.historyCard:hover,.noteCard:hover,.fleetCard:hover,.listCard:hover,.contactItem:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.09);}
.carCard:active,.autoCard:active,.rentalCard:active,.historyCard:active,.noteCard:active,.fleetCard:active,.listCard:active{transform:scale(.992);}
/* плавное открытие/закрытие модальных окон */
.modalOverlay{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity var(--motion) var(--ease),visibility 0s linear var(--motion);}
.modalOverlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transition:opacity var(--motion) var(--ease),visibility 0s linear 0s;}
.modalOverlay .modalCard{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px) scale(.965);transition:opacity var(--motion) var(--ease-spring),transform var(--motion) var(--ease-spring);}
.modalOverlay.open .modalCard{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
/* раскрытия/аккордеоны */
.settingsFolderBody,.folderBody,.accordionBody{transition:max-height .38s var(--ease),opacity .25s var(--ease),padding .3s var(--ease);}
/* переключатели и активные элементы */
.active,.selected,.open{transition:background-color var(--motion) var(--ease),color var(--motion) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--motion) var(--ease),border-color var(--motion) var(--ease);}
/* загрузка/обновление */
#updateOverlay.open{animation:fadeOverlay .25s var(--ease) both;}
@keyframes fadeOverlay{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
/* уважение системной настройки */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}.calculatorScroll>*{animation:none!important}}


/* ===== XCAR MENU BUTTONS — FINAL HARMONIZED PANEL ===== */
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:flex-end;
  gap:7px;
  padding:0;
  margin:0;
  background:transparent;
  border:0;
  box-shadow:none;
  backdrop-filter:none;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:none;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button{
  width:38px!important;
  height:38px!important;
  min-width:38px!important;
  padding:0!important;
  margin:0!important;
  border-radius:12px!important;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.58)!important;
  display:flex!important;
  align-items:center!important;
  justify-content:center!important;
  flex:0 0 38px!important;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(5,24,42,.16), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.72)!important;
  transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow .22s ease,filter .22s ease!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button::before{
  inset:1px!important;
  border-radius:10px!important;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.30),rgba(255,255,255,0))!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button:hover{
  transform:translateY(-2px) scale(1.035)!important;
  box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(5,24,42,.22),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.82)!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button:active{
  transform:translateY(1px) scale(.93)!important;
  box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(5,24,42,.15),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.45)!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .carAddTopBtn{
  width:38px!important;height:38px!important;min-width:38px!important;flex-basis:38px!important;
  border-radius:12px!important;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#38df89,#0ab15f)!important;
  color:#fff!important;font-size:21px!important;font-weight:900!important;
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.38)!important;
  box-shadow:0 7px 17px rgba(10,177,95,.30),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.38)!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .page2QuickBtn,
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notifyBellBtn{
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff,#e9f0f5)!important;
  color:#1d405f!important;
  font-size:16px!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notifyBellBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff7e4,#f4e8ca)!important;color:#80621e!important;font-size:15px!important;}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .serverRefreshBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#eaf6ff,#cfe8f7)!important;color:#1f5e94!important;}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notesTopBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8ed,#f0e2cc)!important;color:#755b39!important;}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .page2CloseBtn{
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e9f1f6,#cbd9e3)!important;
  color:#466277!important;
  font-size:16px!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notifyBellBadge{
  min-width:15px!important;height:15px!important;padding:0 3px!important;
  border-radius:99px!important;font-size:9px!important;line-height:15px!important;
  top:-3px!important;right:-3px!important;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #143b52,0 3px 7px rgba(0,0,0,.18)!important;
}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notesDot{width:6px!important;height:6px!important;top:4px!important;right:4px!important;}
html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderTop{gap:12px!important;}
@media(max-width:620px){
  html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns{gap:6px!important;}
  html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button{width:36px!important;height:36px!important;min-width:36px!important;flex-basis:36px!important;border-radius:11px!important;}
  html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .carAddTopBtn{width:36px!important;height:36px!important;min-width:36px!important;flex-basis:36px!important;}
  html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .page2QuickBtn,html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notifyBellBtn{font-size:15px!important;}
  html[data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderTitle{min-width:0;}
}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns > button{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.18)!important;box-shadow:0 7px 17px rgba(0,0,0,.32),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12)!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .page2QuickBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#edf4f8,#cbd9e2)!important;color:#17334a!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notifyBellBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff0c9,#dfc98d)!important;color:#6c5015!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .serverRefreshBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d9effc,#a9cde1)!important;color:#15517e!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .notesTopBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8eddd,#d8c4a9)!important;color:#624c32!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"][data-ui-style="new"] .page2HeaderBtns .page2CloseBtn{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#dce8ef,#b5c7d3)!important;color:#3d596b!important;}


/* Unified close controls: every X stays in the upper-right corner */
.historyHeaderTop{position:relative;padding-right:46px;}
.historyCloseBtn{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;}
.page2HeaderTop{position:relative;padding-right:46px;}
.page2HeaderBtns{padding-right:38px;}
.page2CloseBtn{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;}
.modalCard{position:relative;}
.modalClose{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;z-index:20;}


/* XCAR — красивое главное окно аккаунта / заметок / чёрного списка / настроек */
.xcarHubModal{max-width:620px!important;padding:22px!important;border-radius:28px!important;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff 0%,#f7faff 100%)!important;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(10,30,55,.28),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.8)!important;}
.xcarHubHead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:4px 4px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7edf4;}
.xcarHubLogo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#10283f,#203f5b);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(19,53,80,.2);}
.xcarHubLogoA{color:#ef3f38;margin-right:1px;}
.xcarHubHead .modalTitle{margin:0!important;font-size:23px!important;line-height:1.15;}
.xcarHubRows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;}
.xcarHubRow{width:100%;min-height:82px;border:1px solid #e5ebf2;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);display:flex;align-items:center;text-align:left;padding:12px 16px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .16s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow .16s ease,border-color .16s ease,background .16s ease;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(25,50,75,.055);}
.xcarHubRow:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:#d5e0eb;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(25,50,75,.11);background:#fff;}
.xcarHubRow:active{transform:scale(.985);}
.xcarHubIcon{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:23px;flex:0 0 50px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.7);}
.xcarHubIcon.account{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e5f0ff,#cfe2ff);}
.xcarHubIcon.notes{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff4d7,#ffe7a2);}
.xcarHubIcon.blacklist{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffe8e8,#ffd2d2);}
.xcarHubIcon.settings{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#edf1f6,#dce4ed);}
.xcarHubText{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:0 14px;}
.xcarHubTitle{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#152b43;line-height:1.2;}
.xcarHubDesc{font-size:12px;color:#7a8796;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.35;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.xcarHubChevron{font-size:31px;line-height:1;color:#9aa8b7;font-weight:300;padding-left:8px;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubModal{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#101c2b,#0b1522)!important;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.65)!important;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubHead{border-color:#24354a;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubRow{background:#122033;border-color:#26394f;box-shadow:none;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubRow:hover{background:#17283b;border-color:#35506b;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubTitle{color:#eef5fb;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubDesc{color:#94a5b8;}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubIcon.account{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1d3855,#17304a);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubIcon.notes{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#514126,#3b301d);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubIcon.blacklist{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#512d31,#3d2327);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .xcarHubIcon.settings{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#303c4c,#253243);}
@media(max-width:560px){.xcarHubModal{max-width:calc(100vw - 18px)!important;padding:17px!important;border-radius:23px!important}.xcarHubHead .modalTitle{font-size:20px!important}.xcarHubRow{min-height:76px;padding:10px 12px}.xcarHubIcon{width:46px;height:46px;flex-basis:46px;border-radius:14px}.xcarHubTitle{font-size:16px}.xcarHubDesc{font-size:11px}}
</style>
<style id="xcar-s25-ultra-redesign">
/* XCAR — Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra full-screen redesign */
:root{
  --s25-bg:#f5f7fa;--s25-card:#ffffff;--s25-ink:#14202b;--s25-muted:#738091;
  --s25-line:#e5eaf0;--s25-blue:#163a63;--s25-green:#12a95a;--s25-red:#e53935;
  --s25-radius:24px;--s25-shadow:0 14px 38px rgba(15,30,48,.09);
}
html,body{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden;}
body{
  display:block!important;padding:0!important;min-height:100dvh!important;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fafc 0%,#eef2f6 100%)!important;
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif!important;
}
.card{
  width:100%!important;max-width:none!important;height:100dvh!important;max-height:none!important;
  min-height:100dvh!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;border-radius:0!important;border:0!important;
  padding:calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 14px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) 14px!important;
  box-shadow:none!important;background:rgba(248,250,252,.98)!important;backdrop-filter:none!important;
}
.topBar{
  height:58px!important;min-height:58px!important;margin:0 -2px 8px!important;
  position:relative!important;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0!important;
}
.logo{font-size:24px!important;letter-spacing:-1px!important;line-height:1!important;margin:0!important;}
.navBtn{width:42px!important;height:42px!important;border-radius:14px!important;top:50%!important;background:#fff!important;border:1px solid #e4e9ef!important;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,35,55,.08)!important;}
.navBtnLeft{left:2px!important}.navBtnRight{right:2px!important}
.calculatorScroll{
  padding:0 1px calc(90px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) 1px!important;
  scrollbar-width:none!important;overflow-y:auto!important;overscroll-behavior-y:contain!important;
}
.calculatorScroll::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none!important}
.label{font-size:12px!important;font-weight:800!important;color:#627082!important;letter-spacing:.15px;margin-top:15px!important}
input,select,textarea{min-height:50px!important;font-size:16px!important;border-radius:16px!important;background:#fff!important;border:1px solid #dfe6ed!important;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(25,40,55,.035)!important}
input,select{padding:13px 15px!important;margin:6px 0 10px!important}
button{min-height:48px!important;border-radius:16px!important;font-size:15px!important}
.btnRow{gap:8px!important}.btnRow button{margin-top:8px!important}
.result{margin-top:12px!important;border-radius:18px!important;padding:15px!important;background:#fff!important;border:1px solid #e2e8ee!important;box-shadow:var(--s25-shadow)!important}
#dailyBreakdown,#reportBottom{border-radius:18px!important;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,30,48,.06)!important}
#carPickerBtn{min-height:58px!important;border-radius:18px!important;background:#fff!important;border:1px solid #dfe6ed!important;color:#1a2a3a!important;box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgba(15,30,48,.06)!important}
.calculatorScroll{contain:layout paint;will-change:scroll-position;}
.topBar{contain:layout paint;}
.page2Drawer,.historyDrawer{contain:layout paint;}
.carPickerBtn .placeholder{color:#8793a2!important}
/* full-screen sheets */
.modalOverlay{padding:0!important;align-items:flex-end!important;background:rgba(9,20,33,.52)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(7px)!important}
.modalCard{width:100%!important;max-width:none!important;max-height:min(92dvh,780px)!important;border-radius:28px 28px 0 0!important;padding:22px 16px calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))!important;box-sizing:border-box!important;box-shadow:0 -18px 55px rgba(5,20,35,.22)!important}
.modalCard:before{border-radius:50%!important}
.modalClose{top:14px!important;right:14px!important;width:38px!important;height:38px!important;border-radius:12px!important;background:#f0f3f6!important}
.modalUpdateBtn{top:14px!important;right:60px!important;width:38px!important;height:38px!important}
.modalTitle{font-size:21px!important;padding-right:80px!important;text-align:left!important}
.modalSub{text-align:left!important;margin-bottom:14px!important}
/* drawers */
.page2Drawer,.historyDrawer{width:100%!important;max-width:none!important;left:0!important;right:0!important;border-radius:28px 28px 0 0!important;box-shadow:0 -18px 60px rgba(8,22,40,.24)!important}
.page2Header{padding-top:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-top))!important;border-radius:28px 28px 0 0!important}
.page2Content{padding:12px 12px calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))!important}
.page2Tabs{padding:10px 10px 0!important}
.page2Tab{min-height:44px!important;font-size:12px!important}
.page2HeaderBtns{gap:6px!important}
.page2HeaderBtns>button,.page2HeaderBtns .carAddTopBtn{width:38px!important;height:38px!important;min-width:38px!important;flex-basis:38px!important;border-radius:12px!important}
.fleetViewSwitch{position:sticky!important;top:0!important;z-index:10!important;margin:0 -1px 12px!important;padding:4px!important;border-radius:15px!important;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)!important}
.fleetViewOpt{min-height:40px!important;padding:7px 4px!important}
.carManageCard{border-radius:20px!important;padding:13px!important;margin-bottom:10px!important;box-shadow:0 7px 22px rgba(19,32,45,.065)!important}
.carManageCard:hover{transform:none!important}
.carPhotoAvatar{border-radius:16px!important}
/* notes: exactly four columns on wide S25, two on narrow fallback */
.notesModalGrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))!important;gap:8px!important}
.noteBox{min-height:108px!important;border-radius:17px!important;padding:10px!important}
.noteText{font-size:11px!important;margin-top:9px!important}
.noteNum{width:27px!important;height:27px!important;border-radius:9px!important}
/* fixed action bar when present */
#rentSaveBtn{box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(18,169,90,.22)!important}
/* Android/S25 touch targets */
button,.navBtn,.modalClose,input,select,.carPickerBtn{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;touch-action:manipulation}
/* dark mode */
html[data-theme="dark"] body{background:#08111d!important}
html[data-theme="dark"] .card{background:#0b1522!important;color:#eef4fb!important}
html[data-theme="dark"] .topBar{border-bottom-color:#223246!important}
html[data-theme="dark"] input,html[data-theme="dark"] select,html[data-theme="dark"] textarea,html[data-theme="dark"] .result,html[data-theme="dark"] #carPickerBtn{background:#101d2d!important;border-color:#2a3c52!important;color:#eef4fb!important}
html[data-theme="dark"] .label{color:#94a3b8!important}
html[data-theme="dark"] .navBtn{background:#122033!important;border-color:#2a3b50!important}
/* S25 Ultra — 4x larger action area for the two central navigation buttons.
   The visible control stays compact; the actual clickable/touch target is 88x88. */
.navBtn{width:88px!important;height:88px!important;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;padding:0!important;overflow:visible!important;touch-action:manipulation!important;}
.navBtn::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:42px;height:42px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e4e9ef;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,35,55,.08),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9);z-index:0;transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow .18s ease,background-color .18s ease;}
.navBtnArrow{position:relative;z-index:3;}
.navBtnRippleFx{z-index:2;pointer-events:none;}
.navBtn:hover::before{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.05);box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(15,35,55,.12),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.95);}
.navBtn:active::before{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.91);box-shadow:0 3px 9px rgba(15,35,55,.12);}
html[data-theme="dark"] .navBtn::before{background:#122033;border-color:#2a3b50;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.24);}
/* compact S25 landscape safety */
@media (max-height:650px){.topBar{height:50px!important;min-height:50px!important}.label{margin-top:9px!important}input,select{min-height:44px!important}.calculatorScroll{padding-bottom:60px!important}}
@media (max-width:370px){.notesModalGrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))!important}.page2Title{font-size:20px!important}}

</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="topBar">
<button type="button" id="navLeftBtn" class="navBtn navBtnLeft" title="История расчётов"><span class="navBtnArrow"></span><span class="navBtnRippleFx"></span></button>
<div class="logo" id="logoBtn">Аренда авто <span class="x">X</span><span class="f">CAR</span></div>
<button type="button" id="navRightBtn" class="navBtn navBtnRight" title="Меню"><span class="navBtnArrow"></span><span class="navBtnRippleFx"></span></button>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="contactsModal">
<div class="modalCard xcarHubModal">
<button class="modalClose" id="modalCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="xcarHubHead">
<div class="xcarHubLogo"><span class="xcarHubLogoA">X</span><span>CAR</span></div>
<div>
<div class="modalTitle">Аренда авто <span class="x">X</span><span class="f">CAR</span></div>
<div class="modalSub">Личный кабинет и управление приложением</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="xcarHubRows">
<button type="button" class="xcarHubRow" id="hubAccountBtn">
<div class="xcarHubIcon account">👤</div><div class="xcarHubText"><div class="xcarHubTitle">Аккаунт</div><div class="xcarHubDesc" id="hubAccountDesc">Вход, регистрация и синхронизация</div></div><div class="xcarHubChevron">›</div>
</button>
<button type="button" class="xcarHubRow" id="hubNotesBtn">
<div class="xcarHubIcon notes">📝</div><div class="xcarHubText"><div class="xcarHubTitle">Заметки</div><div class="xcarHubDesc" id="hubNotesDesc">8 быстрых заметок</div></div><div class="xcarHubChevron">›</div>
</button>
<button type="button" class="xcarHubRow" id="hubBlacklistBtn">
<div class="xcarHubIcon blacklist">🚫</div><div class="xcarHubText"><div class="xcarHubTitle">Чёрный список</div><div class="xcarHubDesc">Проверка клиентов по имени или номеру</div></div><div class="xcarHubChevron">›</div>
</button>
<button type="button" class="xcarHubRow" id="hubSettingsBtn">
<div class="xcarHubIcon settings">⚙️</div><div class="xcarHubText"><div class="xcarHubTitle">Настройки</div><div class="xcarHubDesc">Тема, сервер, резервная копия и параметры</div></div><div class="xcarHubChevron">›</div>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="accountModal">
<div class="modalCard authStandaloneModal">
<button class="modalClose" id="accountModalCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">🔐 Аренда авто <span class="x">X</span><span class="f">CAR</span></div>
<div class="modalSub">Вход и регистрация аккаунта</div>
<div class="authCard authStandaloneCard">
<div class="authCardHeader"><div class="authCardIcon">🔐</div><div><div class="authCardTitle">Аккаунт XCAR</div><div class="authCardSub">Данные аккаунта сохраняются на этом устройстве</div></div></div>
<div class="authModeRow" id="standaloneAuthModeRow"><button type="button" class="authModeOpt active" id="standaloneAuthTabLogin">Вход</button><button type="button" class="authModeOpt" id="standaloneAuthTabRegister">Регистрация</button></div>
<input id="standaloneAccountUsername" placeholder="Логин" autocomplete="username">
<input id="standaloneAccountPassword" type="password" placeholder="Пароль" autocomplete="current-password">
<div id="standaloneAccountRegisterExtra" style="display:none;"><input id="standaloneAccountEmail" type="email" placeholder="Email (необязательно)" autocomplete="email"><input id="standaloneAccountPhone" type="tel" placeholder="Номер телефона (необязательно)" autocomplete="tel"></div>
<div class="btnRow"><button type="button" class="b1" id="standaloneAccountLoginBtn">🔑 Войти</button><button type="button" class="b3" id="standaloneAccountRegisterBtn" style="display:none;">✨ Зарегистрироваться</button></div>
<div class="settingsBackupHint" id="standaloneAccountHint"></div>
</div>
<div class="standaloneAccountState" id="standaloneAccountState"><div class="settingsSectionDesc" id="standaloneAccountStatus">Проверка состояния аккаунта…</div><div class="btnRow" id="standaloneConnectedRow" style="display:none;"><button type="button" class="b1" id="standaloneSyncBtn">🔄 Синхронизировать</button><button type="button" class="b3" id="standaloneLogoutBtn" style="background:#5a6270;">🚪 Выйти</button></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="modalOverlay" id="notifyModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="notifyModalCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">🔔 Уведомления</div>
<div class="modalSub">Оформление и завершение аренды, суммы</div>
<button type="button" class="b3" id="notifyMarkAllReadBtn" style="background:#5a6270;margin-bottom:4px;">✓ Прочитано всё</button>
<div id="notifyList" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="blacklistModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="blacklistCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">🚫 Чёрный список</div>
<div class="modalSub" id="blacklistSub">Обновлено: —</div>
<input id="blacklistSearchInput" placeholder="Имя или номер телефона клиента">
<button type="button" class="b1" id="blacklistSearchBtn" style="margin-bottom:4px;">🔍 Проверить</button>
<div id="blacklistResults" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="settingsModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="settingsCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">⚙️ Настройки</div>
<div class="modalSub">Начисление аренды, аккаунт и резервная копия</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderSubscription">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="subscription">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">👑</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Подписка</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="subscriptionFolderHint">Осталось 365 дней</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="subscriptionCard" id="subscriptionCard">
<div class="subscriptionCardIcon">👑</div>
<div class="subscriptionCardInfo">
<div class="subscriptionCardDays" id="subscriptionCardDays">Осталось 365 дней</div>
<div class="subscriptionCardHint" id="subscriptionCardHint">Нажмите, чтобы продлить подписку</div>
</div>
<div class="subscriptionCardChev">›</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderTheme">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="theme">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">🎨</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Тема оформления</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="themeFolderHint">Белая</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="themeOptRow">
<button type="button" class="themeOpt" id="themeOptLight" data-theme="light">
<div class="themeOptIcon">☀️</div>
<div class="themeOptName">Белая</div>
</button>
<button type="button" class="themeOpt" id="themeOptDark" data-theme="dark">
<div class="themeOptIcon">🌙</div>
<div class="themeOptName">Тёмная</div>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderDesign">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="design">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">✨</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Вид приложения</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="designFolderHint">Стандартный</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="settingsSectionDesc">Выберите классический интерфейс или новый премиальный дизайн. Настройка применяется сразу и сохраняется на устройстве.</div>
<div class="uiStyleRow">
<button type="button" class="uiStyleOpt" id="uiStyleStandard" data-ui-style="standard"><div class="uiStylePreview standardPreview"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div><div class="uiStyleName">Стандартный</div><div class="uiStyleDesc">Текущий интерфейс</div></button>
<button type="button" class="uiStyleOpt" id="uiStyleNew" data-ui-style="new"><div class="uiStylePreview newPreview"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div><div class="uiStyleName">Новый</div><div class="uiStyleDesc">Премиальный стиль</div></button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderServers">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="servers">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">🌐</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Серверы</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint">Render, домашний, другие</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="settingsSectionDesc">Сохраните несколько серверов (Render, домашний на Ubuntu и другие) и переключайтесь между ними</div>
<div class="serverProfileList" id="serverProfileList"></div>
<div class="serverQuickAddRow">
<button type="button" class="serverQuickAddBtn" data-tpl="render">☁️ Render</button>
<button type="button" class="serverQuickAddBtn" data-tpl="home">🏠 Домашний (Ubuntu)</button>
<button type="button" class="serverQuickAddBtn" data-tpl="custom">➕ Другой</button>
</div>
<div class="serverEditBox" id="serverEditBox" style="display:none;">
<input id="serverEditName" placeholder="Название сервера">
<input id="serverEditUrl" placeholder="Адрес, например https://xcar.onrender.com">
<div class="btnRow">
<button type="button" class="b1" id="serverEditSaveBtn">Сохранить</button>
<button type="button" class="b3" id="serverEditCancelBtn" style="background:#5a6270;">Отмена</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="btnRow">
<button type="button" class="b3" id="serverPingAllBtn" style="background:#5a6270;">📶 Проверить все серверы</button>
</div>
<div class="settingsBackupHint" id="serverHint"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderAccount">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="account">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">👤</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Аккаунт и синхронизация</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="accountFolderHint">Без регистрации</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="settingsSectionDesc" id="accountStatusLine">Работает без регистрации — данные хранятся только на этом устройстве</div>
<button type="button" class="accountServerLink" id="accountServerLinkBtn" title="Настройки сервера — в разделе «Серверы» выше">
<span class="accountServerLinkIcon">🌐</span>
<span class="accountServerLinkInfo">
<span class="accountServerLinkLabel">Сервер для входа</span>
<span class="accountServerLinkText" id="accountServerLinkText">Не выбран</span>
</span>
<span class="accountServerLinkChev">Изменить →</span>
</button>

<div id="accountAuthBlock">
<div class="authCard">
<div class="authCardHeader">
<div class="authCardIcon">🔐</div>
<div>
<div class="authCardTitle">Вход в аккаунт</div>
<div class="authCardSub">Чтобы синхронизировать данные между телефонами</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="authModeRow" id="authModeRow">
<button type="button" class="authModeOpt active" id="authTabLogin" data-mode="login">Вход</button>
<button type="button" class="authModeOpt" id="authTabRegister" data-mode="register">Регистрация</button>
</div>
<input id="accountUsername" placeholder="Логин" autocomplete="username">
<input id="accountPassword" type="password" placeholder="Пароль" autocomplete="current-password">
<div id="accountRegisterExtra" style="display:none;">
<input id="accountEmail" type="email" placeholder="Email (необязательно)" autocomplete="email">
<input id="accountPhone" type="tel" placeholder="Номер телефона (необязательно)" autocomplete="tel">
</div>
<div class="btnRow">
<button type="button" class="b1" id="accountLoginBtn">🔑 Войти</button>
<button type="button" class="b3" id="accountRegisterBtn" style="display:none;">✨ Зарегистрироваться</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="btnRow" id="accountConnectedBtnRow" style="display:none;">
<button type="button" class="b1" id="accountSyncNowBtn">🔄 Синхронизировать</button>
<button type="button" class="b3" id="accountLogoutBtn" style="background:#5a6270;">🚪 Выйти</button>
</div>
<label class="rentSwitch" id="pushToggleRow" style="display:none;">
<input type="checkbox" id="pushToggleCheck">
<span class="rentSwitchLabel">🔔 Push-уведомления о действиях на других устройствах</span>
<span class="rentSwitchTrack"><span class="rentSwitchThumb"></span></span>
</label>
<button type="button" class="settingsOpenBtn" id="accountDeleteBtn" style="display:none;margin-top:8px;border-color:#f6cfcf;color:#c62828;">Удалить аккаунт с сервера</button>
<div class="settingsBackupHint" id="accountHint"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderAutoSync">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="autosync">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">🔁</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Автообновление данных</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="autoSyncFolderHint">Каждые 30 сек</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="settingsSectionDesc">Если данные изменились на другом телефоне (автопарк, аренда, история) — приложение само подтянет их с сервера через заданный интервал</div>
<label class="rentSwitch" id="autoSyncToggleRow">
<input type="checkbox" id="autoSyncToggleCheck">
<span class="rentSwitchLabel">Автообновление включено</span>
<span class="rentSwitchTrack"><span class="rentSwitchThumb"></span></span>
</label>
<div class="autoSyncIntervalRow" id="autoSyncIntervalRow">
<div class="autoSyncIntervalLabel">Интервал обновления: <b id="autoSyncIntervalValue">30</b> сек</div>
<input type="range" id="autoSyncIntervalSlider" class="autoSyncSlider" min="1" max="59" step="1" value="30">
<div class="autoSyncIntervalScale"><span>1 сек</span><span>59 сек</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderNav">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="nav">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">🧭</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Кнопки навигации</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="navFolderHint">Стрелки показаны</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="settingsSectionDesc">Стрелки слева и справа от названия «Аренда авто XCAR» открывают историю и меню</div>
<label class="rentSwitch" id="navArrowsToggleRow">
<input type="checkbox" id="navArrowsToggleCheck">
<span class="rentSwitchLabel">Показывать стрелки навигации</span>
<span class="rentSwitchTrack"><span class="rentSwitchThumb"></span></span>
</label>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderBilling">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="billing">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">💳</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Начисление за активную аренду</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint" id="billingFolderHint">Предоплата за сутки</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="billingModeRow">
<button type="button" class="billingModeOpt" id="billingModePrepay" data-mode="prepay">
<div class="billingModeIcon">📅</div>
<div class="billingModeName">Предоплата за сутки</div>
<div class="billingModeDesc">Сутки списываются сразу целиком с момента начала аренды</div>
</button>
<button type="button" class="billingModeOpt" id="billingModePersecond" data-mode="persecond">
<div class="billingModeIcon">⏱️</div>
<div class="billingModeName">Посекундно</div>
<div class="billingModeDesc">Сумма начисляется непрерывно, в реальном времени</div>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="settingsFolder" id="folderBackup">
<div class="settingsFolderHeader" data-folder="backup">
<div class="settingsFolderIconBadge">💾</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHeaderText">
<div class="settingsFolderTitle">Резервная копия</div>
<div class="settingsFolderHint">Машины, история и настройки</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderChev">▾</div>
</div>
<div class="settingsFolderBody">
<div class="btnRow">
<button type="button" class="b1" id="settingsExportBtn">Экспортировать</button>
<button type="button" class="b3" id="settingsImportBtn">Импортировать</button>
</div>
<textarea id="settingsBackupText" class="settingsBackupText" placeholder="Нажмите «Экспортировать», чтобы получить текст резервной копии, или вставьте сюда ранее сохранённый текст и нажмите «Импортировать»"></textarea>
<div class="settingsBackupHint" id="settingsBackupHint"></div>
</div>
</div>

<button type="button" class="historyClearBtn updateAppBtn" id="updateAppBtn" style="margin:6px auto 4px;"><span class="historyClearFill"></span><span class="historyClearLabelText">🔄 Обновить приложение (удержать 2 сек)</span></button>

</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="subscriptionModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="subscriptionCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">👑 Подписка XCAR</div>
<div class="modalSub" id="subscriptionModalSub">Осталось 365 дней</div>

<div class="subRequisites" id="subRequisites"></div>
<div class="subQrWrap"><canvas id="subQrCanvas" width="160" height="160"></canvas></div>

<div class="label"><span class="icon">👤</span>Ваши Ф.И.О</div>
<input id="subClientName" placeholder="Фамилия Имя Отчество">
<div class="label"><span class="icon">📞</span>Ваш номер телефона</div>
<input id="subClientPhone" type="tel" placeholder="+7 900 000-00-00">

<button type="button" class="b7" id="subSendRequestBtn" style="margin-top:14px;">✅ Я оплатил(а) — отправить заявку</button>
<div class="settingsBackupHint" id="subRequestHint"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="updateOverlay">
<div class="updateAnimBox">
<div class="updateRing">🚗</div>
<div class="updateAnimText">Обновляем приложение…</div>
<div class="updateAnimSub">Это займёт пару секунд</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="carPickerModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="carPickerCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">Выбор автомобиля</div>
<div class="modalSub">Нажмите на машину, чтобы выбрать</div>
<div class="carListWrap" id="carPickerList"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modalOverlay" id="rentModal">
<div class="modalCard">
<button class="modalClose" id="rentModalCloseBtn">✕</button>
<div class="modalTitle">🔑 Оформление аренды</div>
<div class="modalSub" id="rentModalCarName">Автомобиль</div>

<div class="label"><span class="icon">🗓️</span>Начало аренды: дата и время</div>
<div class="rentFormRow">
<input type="date" id="rentStartDate">
<input type="time" id="rentStartTime">
</div>

<div class="label"><span class="icon">🏁</span>Окончание: дата и время</div>
<div class="rentFormRow">
<input type="date" id="rentEndDate">
